-- B1-FILE-WITHDRAWAL-IMPACT-ACK-NULL-GUARD-01
-- FORWARD-ONLY DRAFT. SOURCE ONLY. DO NOT APPLY WITHOUT SEPARATE APPROVAL.
--
-- Closes submit bypass found by integrated runtime E2E:
